# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your knowledge of tools for handling noise and errors and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Sostieni un esame di 20 domande sul sito IBM Training per mettere alla prova le tue conoscenze degli strumenti per gestire rumore ed errori e ricevi un badge tramite Credly."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam  | Tools for quantum advantage"
msgstr "Esame | Strumenti per il vantaggio quantistico"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam and badge {#exam-and-badge}"
msgstr "Esame e badge {#exam-and-badge}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/tools-for-quantum-advantage/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/tools-for-quantum-advantage/badge.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Metti alla prova le tue conoscenze {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM Training, where you can take the badging exam for General formulation of quantum information.\n"
msgstr "Dopo aver completato le letture e le attività di questo corso, fai clic sul pulsante qui sotto per andare a IBM Training, dove puoi sostenere l'esame per il badge su General formulation of quantum information.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr "L'esame consiste in 20 domande e devi rispondere correttamente ad almeno 16 per superarlo. Una volta ottenuto un punteggio sufficiente, il tuo badge verrà inviato automaticamente all'indirizzo email che hai usato per registrarti a IBM Training.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Assicurati di essere pronto a sostenere l'esame. Se non ottieni un punteggio sufficiente in due tentativi, l'esame viene temporaneamente bloccato.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice: These exams on the IBM Training site may be temporarily unavailable in the next few days, due to maintenance.\n"
msgstr "Avviso: questi esami sul sito IBM Training potrebbero essere temporaneamente non disponibili nei prossimi giorni a causa di manutenzione.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/tools-for-quantum-advantage-badge-quiz-DL46113G\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/).\n"
msgstr "AVVISO: IBM si avvale dei servizi di Credly, un responsabile del trattamento dei dati di terze parti autorizzato da IBM e con sede negli Stati Uniti, per assistere nell'amministrazione del programma IBM Digital Badge. Per rilasciarti un IBM Digital Badge, le tue informazioni personali (nome, indirizzo email e badge ottenuto) saranno condivise con Credly. Riceverai una notifica email da Credly con le istruzioni per richiedere il badge. Le tue informazioni personali vengono utilizzate per rilasciare il badge e per finalità di reportistica e operative del programma. IBM può condividere le informazioni personali raccolte con le società affiliate di IBM e con terze parti in tutto il mondo. Saranno trattate in modo coerente con le pratiche di IBM sulla privacy. L'IBM Privacy Statement può essere consultata [qui](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/).\n"
